# ==============================================================================
# IGBT 单管透明料管视觉防呆系统 · Root .gitignore
# 适配私有 GitHub 仓库：严格屏蔽运行期数据库、现场证据图、AI 训练样本、
# 模型权重、前端构建产物、依赖缓存与本地敏感凭据。
# ==============================================================================

# --- Environment & Secrets (严禁提交任何凭据与口令) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# --- Runtime Business DB & Evidence (SQLite 业务库与现场快照) ---
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm
*.sqlite
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
**/data/station.sqlite3*
**/data/evidence/

# --- AI Training Dataset & Model Artifacts (训练集图片与模型权重) ---
**/data/dataset/
**/data/runs/
IGBT_PokaYoke_Development_Package/data/
runs/
backup/
*.pth
*.pt
*.onnx
*.onnx.data
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.bin

# --- Python Cache, Virtual Environments & Tooling ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/
.Python
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

# --- Node.js & Frontend Build Artifacts ---
node_modules/
**/web/dist/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.local
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# --- Logs & Temporary Files ---
logs/
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig

# --- OS & IDE Metadata ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.swp
*.swo
